  m_Name: 1965
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: 'Independence and Nation-Building 1965 '
  info: "On August 9, 1965, Singapore becomes a fully independent nation after being
    expelled from Malaysia. Facing immense challenges such as limited natural resources,
    a small land area, and a lack of defense infrastructure, Singapore focuses on
    survival and development. Under Lee Kuan Yew\u2019s leadership, the government
    prioritizes industrialization, foreign investment, education, and housing. Over
    the decades, Singapore evolves into a global financial hub and one of the world\u2019s
    most successful economies, renowned for its stability and multicultural harmony."
  image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f67ded3ac7bbb49c487b247f821248f0, type: 3}
